Was this ever resolved for everyone?  The message below indicates that the issue was, probably, that the file was not being found.   This could occur if the filename (lgdata_fn) had a typo, or didn't have the full directory path, or had the wrong decision about forward-slashes (most systems) versus double-backslashes (some windows systems), or, if no path was specified, the file was not in the working directory.

Cheers, Nick

